  the .on("dblclick") wiring deleted -> RED, '2 of 7 lines are gone'.

THE DOUBLE-CLICK ARM SEEDS AN ISOLATION AND THAT IS THE ARM: from the empty state the two clicks toggle on and off and land on "" unaided, so it would be green either way. It is witnessed on a mark that does NOT open -- on one that does, drawChart clears the isolation regardless, which the arm asserts and says in its detail.

